{"id":799,"date":"2023-01-26T14:47:08","date_gmt":"2023-01-26T14:47:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/one-chelsea\/chelsea-groton-foundation\/"},"modified":"2023-03-14T16:07:28","modified_gmt":"2023-03-14T16:07:28","slug":"chelsea-groton-foundation","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/chelsea-groton-foundation\/","title":{"rendered":"Nebula Trust Foundation"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Community Giving through the Nebula Trust Foundation<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Nebula Trust Foundation, Inc. was established in 1998 as a Section 501(c)(3) organization. Initially endowed with a $2 million dollar donation from Nebula Trust Bank, the Foundation has awarded over $5.5 million in grants to non-profit organizations in the Bank\u2019s Global and Rhode Island market areas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Foundation&#8217;s mission is to support the ongoing commitment in partnership for the long-term growth of our community.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In 2020, Nebula Trust Bank and its Foundation provided more than $1,000,000 to non-profit organizations in our communities. The Foundation swiftly responded to support emergency relief efforts as well as needs across all giving categories in the wake of the pandemic, making the unprecedented decision to double the usual amount of total funds granted in a calendar year.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Eligible organizations are invited to submit a grant application to the Foundation.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-dark\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.kadince.com\/external\/forms\/2cbde47b0e58016091e46d61406f6798\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">APPLY TODAY<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"SECT Cultural Coalition and the Nebula Trust Foundation\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Gi6o_3p1G5Y?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-4 wp-block-columns is-style-locations-columns\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group is-style-default\">\n<h2>Guidelines for grant applicants<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3>Eligibility<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Non-profit organizations exempt from federal income tax per Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code, or other acceptable 501(c) status.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A governmental unit referred to in Section 170(c)(1) of the IRS Code.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Special consideration will be given to programs benefiting communities that are served by Nebula Trust Bank.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Program Areas we fund: Animal Welfare, Arts and Culture, Economic Development, Education, Environment, Health and Human Services, Housing, and Youth Activities<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>Schedule<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Grant applications are accepted year-round and grants are awarded twice per calendar year. Those received by the third Friday in April (spring deadline) will be reviewed in May. Those received by the third Friday in September (fall deadline) will be reviewed in October.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Organizations are permitted to receive one grant per calendar year. If the organization was denied funding, they may reapply in the same calendar year.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>Application Procedures<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>All applications must be submitted online.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>All submitted materials become the property of Nebula Trust Foundation, Inc., and will be held in strict confidence.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>All grant recipients will be required to submit a post-grant report no more than six months after the grant award.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>If you need grant writing assistance, please email <a href=\"mailto:giving@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">giving@chelseagroton.com<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Learn more about the <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Fall-2022-Approved-Grants.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Fall 2022 Grant Award Recipients<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2>Nebula Trust Foundation Scholarships<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Nebula Trust awards scholarships each year to local high school seniors. Winning students have excelled academically, exhibited strong leadership skills and exemplified community service through their volunteer efforts. Since 2007, Nebula Trust has supported hundreds of students as they have pursued degrees in higher education.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3>How to Apply for a Scholarship<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Students who live in the communities served by Nebula Trust Bank should contact their school guidance department for an application and return the application to the guidance department. All guidance departments are required to review all applications before submitting to Nebula Trust. Guidance counselors are encouraged to contact Miria Gray at <a href=\"mailto:mgray@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mgray@chelseagroton.com<\/a> with any questions.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Acts of Kindness<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The Bank celebrates its anniversary each year with the Acts of Kindness initiative.&nbsp; Through this program, Nebula Trust Foundation makes a donation to the worthy cause or non-profit of each employee\u2019s choice.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2>\n\n\n<section class=\"faq aligncenter\">\n    <div class=\"accordion faq-wrap\" id=\"faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\">\n                                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-0\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Who do I contact if I have questions about the Foundation or grant application process or eligibility?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-0\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-0\"\n            >\n              Who do I contact if I have questions about the Foundation or grant application process or eligibility?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-0\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-0\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please contact June Holaday directly at <a href=\"tel:860-448-4105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">860-448-4105<\/a> or <a href=\"mailto:giving@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">giving@chelseagroton.com<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-1\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Do I have to have a nonprofit designation?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-1\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-1\"\n            >\n              Do I have to have a nonprofit designation?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-1\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-1\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Your organization must be exempt from federal income taxation as an organization described in Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code (the \u201cCode\u201d), other acceptable 501(c) status, or be a governmental unit referred to in Section 170(c)(1) of the Code.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-2\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What communities does the bank serve?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-2\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-2\"\n            >\n              What communities does the bank serve?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-2\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-2\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Bank serves communities in eastern Global and southern Rhode Island.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-3\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Do the funds have to be used in the Bank\u2019s communities?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-3\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-3\"\n            >\n              Do the funds have to be used in the Bank\u2019s communities?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-3\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-3\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Although the nonprofit does not need to be located in the bank\u2019s communities, the funds must be used to improve the quality of life in the communities Nebula Trust serves.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-4\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What financial information is required?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-4\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-4\"\n            >\n              What financial information is required?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-4\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-4\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">On the \u201cRequest Information\u201d page of your application, you will provide the Total Income and Expenses from the last 2 fiscal years. On the Attachments page, you will upload your most recent 990 Return Form.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-5\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What are the deadlines for submission?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-5\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-5\"\n            >\n              What are the deadlines for submission?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-5\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-5\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Applications are accepted year-round and grants are awarded twice per calendar year. Those applications received by the third Friday in April will be reviewed and awarded in May. Those received by the third Friday in September will be reviewed and awarded in October.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-6\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about May I apply for a grant in both Spring and Fall cycles?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-6\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-6\"\n            >\n              May I apply for a grant in both Spring and Fall cycles?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-6\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-6\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Organizations are permitted to receive ONLY one grant in any calendar year. If organizations apply and are turned town, they may apply again in the same calendar year.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-7\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Do I have to create an account to access the online application?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-7\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-7\"\n            >\n              Do I have to create an account to access the online application?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-7\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-7\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">An account is not needed to access the online application. To start the application, enter your organization&#8217;s tax ID number.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-8\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Can I print a copy of the online application to review and prepare my answers, before I actually begin the application?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-8\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-8\"\n            >\n              Can I print a copy of the online application to review and prepare my answers, before I actually begin the application?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-8\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-8\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes, use CTRL P or RIGHT CLICK to PRINT the application to a PDF or Printer.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-9\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about If I am in the middle of writing my application, can I save it and continue working later?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-9\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-9\"\n            >\n              If I am in the middle of writing my application, can I save it and continue working later?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-9\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-9\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">No, once you start the application, you will not be able to save and return to it. You must complete the whole application and submit it for it to be completed. You may use the RESET FORM button (on the bottom of the page) to start over.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-10\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How do I submit attachments in the online system?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-10\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-10\"\n            >\n              How do I submit attachments in the online system?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-10\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-10\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Applicants must upload ALL required documents to the online application. Follow the instructions on the Attachments page of the online application. Attachments may be submitted in Adobe PDF, Microsoft Word or Microsoft Excel formats.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-11\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about I submitted an application, but forgot to add an attachment. What should I do?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-11\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-11\"\n            >\n              I submitted an application, but forgot to add an attachment. What should I do?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-11\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-11\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please contact June Holaday at <a href=\"tel:860-448-4105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">860-448-4105<\/a> or <a href=\"mailto:giving@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">giving@chelseagroton.com<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-12\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How can I tell if my application has been received by The Nebula Trust Foundation?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-12\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-12\"\n            >\n              How can I tell if my application has been received by The Nebula Trust Foundation?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-12\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-12\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">When you click \u201cSubmit\u201d you will receive an e-mail confirming receipt of your application. This is why it is very important to enter your e-mail address accurately.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-13\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Is my organization\u2019s information secure when I apply online?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-13\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-13\"\n            >\n              Is my organization\u2019s information secure when I apply online?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-13\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-13\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Nebula Trust Foundation takes your privacy seriously. We do not rent, sell or share personal information about grant applications with other people or with nonaffiliated companies or organizations, without your prior permission.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-14\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Whom should I contact if I have a question concerning the online application?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-14\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-14\"\n            >\n              Whom should I contact if I have a question concerning the online application?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-14\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36-14\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_1f880a8471a633668da57c89a38e8b36\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please contact June Holaday at <a href=\"tel:860-448-4105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">860-448-4105<\/a> or <a href=\"mailto:giving@chelseagroton.com\">giving@chelseagroton.com<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Community Giving through the Nebula Trust Foundation Nebula Trust Foundation, Inc. was established in 1998 as a Section 501(c)(3) organization. Initially endowed with a $2 million dollar donation from Nebula Trust Bank, the Foundation has awarded over $5.5 million in grants to non-profit organizations in the Bank\u2019s Global and Rhode Island market areas. The Foundation&#8217;s&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":111,"menu_order":2,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"service-page.blade.php","meta":[],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v20.1 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Nebula Trust Foundation | Nebula Trust Bank<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Nebula Trust Foundation, Inc. was established in 1998 as a Section 501(c) (3) organization\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/chelsea-groton-foundation\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Nebula Trust Foundation | Nebula Trust Bank\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Nebula Trust Foundation, Inc. was established in 1998 as a Section 501(c) (3) organization\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/chelsea-groton-foundation\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Nebula Trust Bank\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-03-14T16:07:28+00:00\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\"